       "target": "map.basemap",
       "message": "Click here to pick a different basemap"
      }
     },
     "result": "Highlighted map.basemap"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "I've put a ring around the basemap button on the map. Click it to choose from the available basemaps. Pick one and the map switches straight away."
