      }
     },
     "result": "Opened settings"
    },
    {
     "tool": "run_ui_action",
     "input": {
      "id": "ui:highlight",
      "params": {
       "target": "settings.terminalPlacement",
       "message": "Tick this to give the terminal its own pane"
      }
     },
     "result": "Highlighted settings.terminalPlacement"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "I've opened Settings and ringed the option you want: Settings → Terminal → \"Give the terminal its own pane\". Turn it on and the terminal moves out of the console's tab strip into a pane of its own. Turn it off again to put it back beside the console."
